<title>SINGAPORE: Avimo seeks trading suspension on Dec 5.</title>
<headline>Avimo seeks trading suspension on Dec 5.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defence equipment group Avimo Group Ltd said on Wednesday it had asked the Stock Exchange of Singapore to suspend trading of its shares on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the suspension request was made pending an announcement. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
